---
type: person
name: {{ person.full_name | yaml }}
title: {{ person.position | yaml }}
company: {{ person.company | yaml if person.company else 'null' }}
connected_on: {{ person.connected_on | yaml }}
last_contacted: {{ (person.metadata.last_contacted or 'Never') | yaml }}
tags:
  - network
---
# {{ person.full_name }}

**Company:** [[{{ person.company|replace(' ', '_') if person.company else 'Unknown_Company' }}]]

## Achievements
{% for achievement in person.metadata.achievements %}
- {{ achievement }}
{% endfor %}

## Associated Jobs
{% for job in jobs %}
- [[{{ job.filename }}|{{ job.title }}]] ({{ job.status }})
{% else %}
- No jobs found at this company.
{% endfor %}

## Referral Messages
{% for req in referrals %}
### Job: {{ req.job_id }} ({{ req.created_at }})
- **Status:** {{ req.status }}
- **Message:**
> {{ req.message_content }}

{% else %}
- No referral messages sent to this person yet.
{% endfor %}

## Notes
{{ person.metadata.notes or '' }}
